## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical use of CMK with storage in Azure and policy-driven governance across subscriptions; includes rollout, rollback, and testing.

## Key Concepts
- CMK in Azure Key Vault
- Azure Policy with DeployIfNotExists/AuditIfNotExists
- Key rotation, backups, and compliance reporting
- Per-subscription scoping and rollout testing

## Code Example
```json
{
  "policyName": "StorageAccounts-CMKBackedEncryption",
  "policyRule": {
    "if": {
      "allOf": [
        {"field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts"},
        {"field": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/encryption.keySource", "notEquals": "Microsoft.KeyVault"}
      ]
    },
    "then": {"effect": "deny"}
  },
  "parameters": {
    "keyVault": {"type": "String"}
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle existing storage accounts that already use platform-managed keys?
- What monitoring/auditing would you add to ensure ongoing CMK compliance?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical guardrail design across multi-subscription data platforms, focusing real-world constraints like admin elevation, secrets hygiene, data egress controls, governance, monitoring, and rollback.

## Key Concepts

- Least-privilege RBAC with PIM
- Key Vault secrets + policy gating
- Private Link / firewall-based egress controls
- Data governance and DLP
- UEBA with Azure Sentinel
- Canary deployments and GitOps rollback

## Code Example

```json
{
  "policyRule": {
    "if": {
      "allOf": [
        { "field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Web/sites" },
        { "anyOf": [
          { "field": "siteConfig.appSettings[*].value", "like": "*SECRET*" },
          { "field": "siteConfig.connectionStrings[*].value", "like": "*SECRET*" }
        ] }
      ]
    },
    "then": { "effect": "deny" }
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you verify the guardrail without affecting production?
- What telemetry and alerting would prove efficacy and catch anomalies quickly?
